DePSI Scientific-Use License

This software is intended for scientific use only. Applications for
commercial use are prohibited.

depsipy is a Python re-implementation of the DePSI toolbox (persistent
scatterer InSAR time-series processing) developed by the Delft Institute
of Earth Observation and Space Systems, Delft University of Technology.
The algorithms and file formats follow the original DePSI v1.7.8.8
toolbox; the license terms of the original software are retained here.

